+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+config NANOHUB
+	tristate "Nanohub sensor hub (Nexus 5X)"
+	depends on SPI && GPIOLIB && OF
+	help
+	  The Nexus 5X's sensor hub: an STM32 microcontroller on SPI running
+	  Google's nanohub firmware, behind which sit all the phone's sensors.
+	  Provides /dev/nanohub for the Android sensors HAL. Data path only:
+	  it never updates the hub's firmware.
+
+	  If in doubt, say N here.
